Whole-epic adversarial review, the last step (load adversarial-self-review). Sweep the ENTIRE CQ-C diff: every epic task's commits on moe/work-2026-10-24, plus C11a's docs read against the code. Check:
- any approval bypass, or a re-stamped approval;
- a planner skipped outside valid reuse or an eligible recipe;
- scope expansion past the approved plan;
- stale context served as fresh;
- a cache answering 'absent' on incomplete enumeration, or freshness taken from watchers or status;
- a delta served across an incarnation;
- recipe identity impersonation, or a definition changeable without approval;
